<title>SINGAPORE: Lum Chang units win Singapore land tender.</title>
<headline>Lum Chang units win Singapore land tender.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two units of Lum Chang Holdings Ltd, Waterbank Properties and Comfort Group, won a Singapore $139 million land tender on Wednesday, state television reported.</p>
<p>The site in western Singapore is for top-end public housing.</p>
<p>Another site in the north was awarded to government-linked Pidemco Land for about S$196 million, it said.</p>
<p>--Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
